# --- Sanity (public, safe to expose in the browser) ---------------------
# These have safe defaults baked into src/sanity/env.ts, so the app runs
# without a .env file. Set them explicitly on your host (e.g. Vercel) if
# you ever need to point at a different project/dataset.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SANITY_PROJECT_ID=1cml7kb6
NEXT_PUBLIC_SANITY_DATASET=production

# --- Optional (server-only, never commit a real value) ------------------
# Only needed later for draft previews / the Live Content API. Create a
# read token in https://www.sanity.io/manage and set it on the host.
# SANITY_API_READ_TOKEN=
